@startuml state-payment
' PayLink - Payment life-cycle State Diagram (Phase 1) - Owner: Student 2 (Requirements Co-Lead)
' Source of truth: brief section 2.5 (the table of allowed transitions). Nothing else is allowed.
' Generated with AI assistance, then checked line by line against the brief table.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5EE
  BorderColor #2E7D5B
  ArrowColor #455A64
  FontSize 13
}
skinparam state<<final>> {
  BackgroundColor #EEEEEE
  BorderColor #455A64
}
skinparam state<<uncertain>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E1
  BorderColor #F9A825
}
skinparam state<<failed>> {
  BackgroundColor #FDECEA
  BorderColor #C62828
}

title PayLink - Payment Life Cycle (FR-11)

state Initiated
state FundsHeld
state SentToBiller
state Unknown <<uncertain>>
state Failed <<failed>>
state Rejected <<final>>
state Completed <<final>>
state Refunded <<final>>

[*] --> Initiated : payment created\n(idempotency key stored)

Initiated --> FundsHeld : fraud checks pass AND\nwallet has enough funds
Initiated --> Rejected : fraud check fails OR\nfunds insufficient

FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : request sent to biller

SentToBiller --> Completed : biller confirms
SentToBiller --> Failed : biller refuses
SentToBiller --> Unknown : no answer within timeout\n(10 s for live billers)

Unknown --> Completed : biller later confirms\n(callback, retry or settlement file)
Unknown --> Failed : biller later refuses OR\nreconciliation finds no payment
Unknown --> Unknown : re-query, still no answer\n(after 1, 5, 15 min; max 3)

Failed --> Refunded : hold released to the wallet

Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

note right of Initiated
  Entry: nothing is held yet.
  Rejected here means no money moved
  and the biller is never called.
end note

note right of FundsHeld
  Entry: ledger moves amount + fee
  from Available to Held (FR-12).
  The biller is called only after this.
end note

note bottom of Unknown
  Money stays HELD.
  Never refunded automatically:
  only after the system is sure the
  biller did not receive the payment.
end note

note bottom of Failed
  Not final: the hold must still be released.
  Entry action of Refunded: release hold (FR-12).
end note

note left of Completed
  Entry: hold becomes final charge,
  PayLink fee income is credited,
  agent commission recorded (40% of fee),
  SMS + push sent (FR-22).
end note

legend right
  <b>Final states:</b> Completed, Rejected, Refunded
  Any event not drawn here is NOT a valid transition
  and is rejected without changing the payment.
  Duplicate callbacks in a final state are ignored and logged.
endlegend
@enduml
